<title>USA: TABLE - Professional Staff Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Professional Staff Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 months to June 30th</p>
<p>						1997		 1996</p>
<p> Revenue				    6,454 pounds  4,580 pounds</p>
<p> Net income				   766	     463</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>   shares outstanding		   6,686	   4,852</p>
<p>Fully diluted earnings per share</p>
<p>						0.11	    0.10</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said current Q1 results include a non-recurring, pre-tax gain of 100,000 pounds ($167,000) on the sale a database copy acquired as part of its acquisition of Salisbury Consulting Group.</p>
<p>All amounts pound Sterling, including per share numbers.</p>
<p>Full name is Professional Staff Plc.</p>
</text>
